flowchart LR
    BK[Booking services<br/>hotel and flight] -->|authorize, capture, void, refund<br/>with idempotency key| PS[Payment service<br/>state machine, attempt log]
    PS --> PDB[(Payments DB<br/>payment, attempt,<br/>idempotency, outbox)]
    PS --> LG[(Ledger<br/>append-only double entry)]
    PS --> RT[PSP router<br/>by currency, country,<br/>scheme, health]
    RT --> P1[Stripe adapter]
    RT --> P2[Adyen adapter]
    RT --> P3[Local rails adapter]
    P1 & P2 & P3 --> PSP[External PSPs]
    PSP -->|signed webhooks| WH[Webhook receiver<br/>verify, dedupe on event id]
    WH --> PS
    PL[Pending poller] --> PS
    PDB -->|outbox relay| K[Kafka payment events]
    K --> BK
    K --> RC[Reconciliation service]
    PSP -->|daily settlement reports| RC
    LG --> RC
    RC --> OQ[Discrepancy queue<br/>finance operations]
